  "releaseNotes": "Hqub.MusicBrainz version 4.0 breaking changes:\n\n\t\t* Consistently return QueryResult instead of specialized collection types from search and browse requests.\n\t\t* Removal of Hqub.MusicBrainz.Entities.Collections namespace.\n\t\t* Removal of Area.IsoCodes property (use Iso1Codes or Iso2Codes instead).\n\n\t\tOther changes in version 4.0:\n\n\t\t* Introduce IEntity as base interface for all entity classes supported by services.\n\t\t* Add support for Area relationships.\n\t\t* Add support for Area lookup to MusicBrainz client.\n\t\t* Add missing Release.Packaging property.",
